# Pull request style

Pull request guidance is provided by the pstack plugin: https://github.com/cursor/plugins/tree/main/pstack

Repo-specific house rules:
- **Title:** plain words that say what changed. No "N of M" numbering and no `type(scope):` prefix.
- **Open it ready for review**, not as a draft.
- **Body:** under about 200 words.
- Refer to other pull requests by number (#3), not by their place in a plan.
